Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Library books for Garion Wendell, tier 10 (Friend of the Library). A running loop from the Stormwind Mage Tower through Darkshore, Ashenvale, Stonetalon, the Barrens, Hillsbrad, Silverpine, Westfall, Elwynn and Ironforge. Flight points and the hearthstone are optional. About 2.5 hours. \\ Stonard and Duskwood (Mor'Ladim) are not on this route: do not take a shortcut through them. \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[GA Alliance]
[N 18 Library Books Alliance Tier 10]
[NX 39 Library Books Alliance Tier 20]

Talk to Garion Wendell in the Mage Tower and accept [QA78150 Friend of the Library] [G48.9,86.5 Stormwind City]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Stormwind] flight path [G71.6,72.3 Stormwind City] (hub: flies to every Alliance point in the Eastern Kingdoms)
Run to the harbor pier for the Auberdine boat [G21.8,56.9 Stormwind City]
Take the boat to Auberdine [G30.5,40.9 Darkshore]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Auberdine] flight path [G36.4,45.6 Darkshore] (hub: flies to every Alliance point in Kalimdor)

Follow the road north-east and loot *Nar'thalas Almanac, Vol. 74*, accept [QA78124] [G37,44 Darkshore][G41,40 Darkshore][G46,30 Darkshore][G52,25 Darkshore][G59.6,22.2 Darkshore] \\ Baron Marinous and Lady Vespira walk the coast nearby: keep your distance.
Run back down the main road south into Ashenvale [G52,25 Darkshore][G46,30 Darkshore][G41,40 Darkshore][G44,58 Darkshore][G44,76 Darkshore][G43,92 Darkshore]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Astranaar] flight path [G34.5,48.0 Ashenvale]
Follow the Ashenvale road past Astranaar to the Talondeep Path entrance [G28,14 Ashenvale][G27,36 Ashenvale][G35,48 Ashenvale][G39,61 Ashenvale][G42.5,71 Ashenvale] \\ Ashenvale mobs reach level 25+: stick to the road.
Go through Talondeep Path and down the east side of Stonetalon, loot *Fury of the Land*, accept [QA78149] [G78,42 Stonetalon Mountains][G79.5,60 Stonetalon Mountains][G84.2,72 Stonetalon Mountains][G81,78.5 Stonetalon Mountains][G74.4,85.7 Stonetalon Mountains] \\ Stonetalon mobs are above your level, Grimtotem camps lie off the road: stick to the road.
Run through the pass into the Barrens [G82,96 Stonetalon Mountains]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Stonetalon Peak] flight path [G36.4,7.2 Stonetalon Mountains] (far north of the road through enemy-level mobs; skip unless you want it)
[OC]Optional: get the [P Ratchet] flight path [G63.1,37.1 The Barrens] (neutral; links to the Alliance points in Kalimdor)

Run north past the Crossroads and loot *Arcanic Systems Manual*, accept [QA78145] [G35.5,27.5 The Barrens][G43,31 The Barrens][G51,20 The Barrens][G56.3,8.8 The Barrens] \\ Razormane elites (Berserker, Flesheater, level 18-19) roam the north road: watch for them. Keep clear of the Crossroads guards.
Loot *Baxtan: On Destructive Magics*, accept [QA79097] [G51,20 The Barrens][G56,31 The Barrens][G59,34 The Barrens][G62.7,36.3 The Barrens] \\ Bruuz (elite, 20) patrols near the book.
Loot *Secrets of the Dreamers* at the Wailing Caverns mouth, accept [QA78143] [G59,34 The Barrens][G56,31 The Barrens][G49.3,32.9 The Barrens] \\ Deviate elites (15-17) guard the cave mouth: pull them one at a time or bring a friend.
Run back west to the Stonetalon pass [G43,31 The Barrens][G35.5,27.5 The Barrens]
Back through Stonetalon to Talondeep Path, on the road [G82,96 Stonetalon Mountains][G74.4,85.7 Stonetalon Mountains][G81,78.5 Stonetalon Mountains][G84.2,72 Stonetalon Mountains][G79.5,60 Stonetalon Mountains][G78,42 Stonetalon Mountains]
Back north through Ashenvale, on the road [G42.5,71 Ashenvale][G39,61 Ashenvale][G35,48 Ashenvale][G27,36 Ashenvale][G28,14 Ashenvale]
Back to Auberdine, to the pier for the Menethil boat [G43,92 Darkshore][G44,76 Darkshore][G44,58 Darkshore][G41,40 Darkshore][G37,44 Darkshore][G32.3,44.1 Darkshore]

Take the boat to Menethil Harbor and stay on it [G4.5,56.7 Wetlands]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Menethil Harbor] flight path [G9.5,59.7 Wetlands]
Take the boat on to Southshore [G50.7,70.4 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Southshore] flight path [G49.4,52.1 Hillsbrad Foothills]
Follow the Hillsbrad road west to Silverpine [G50,58 Hillsbrad Foothills][G35,48 Hillsbrad Foothills][G15,45 Hillsbrad Foothills] \\ Hillsbrad mobs are above your level: stick to the road.
Loot *The Dalaran Digest, Vol. 23*, accept [QA78127] [G60,68 Silverpine Forest][G63.5,63.2 Silverpine Forest] \\ Son of Arugal (elite) can spawn at night in south Silverpine: run if you see him. Silverpine mobs here reach your level and above: stick to the road.
Run back to the Southshore pier [G60,68 Silverpine Forest][G15,45 Hillsbrad Foothills][G35,48 Hillsbrad Foothills][G50,58 Hillsbrad Foothills][G50.7,70.4 Hillsbrad Foothills]
Take the boat back to Auberdine [G32.3,44.1 Darkshore]
Walk to the Stormwind boat pier [G37,44 Darkshore][G30.5,40.9 Darkshore] \\ Optional: if your hearthstone is set in Stormwind, hearth now [H] instead.
Take the boat to Stormwind [G21.8,56.9 Stormwind City]

Run to the Deeprun Tram in the Dwarven District [G72,27.6 Stormwind City]
Ride the tram to Ironforge [G84.1,53.1 Ironforge]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Ironforge] flight path [G55.9,47.9 Ironforge] (hub: flies to every Alliance point in the Eastern Kingdoms)
Loot *Archmage Antonidas: The Unabridged Autobiography*, accept [QA79091] [G62,30 Ironforge][G76,10.4 Ironforge]
Ride the tram back to Stormwind [G62,30 Ironforge][G84.1,53.1 Ironforge][G72,27.6 Stormwind City]
Turn in the books so far at Garion Wendell: [QT78124] [QT78149] [QT78145] [QT79097] [QT78143] [QT78127] [QT79091] [G48.9,86.5 Stormwind City]
Run out the gate and west through Elwynn to Westfall [G32,49.6 Elwynn Forest][G38,58 Elwynn Forest][G42.1,65.9 Elwynn Forest][G33,71 Elwynn Forest][G24.5,74.5 Elwynn Forest]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Sentinel Hill] flight path [G56.6,52.7 Westfall]
Loot *Bewitchments and Glamours*, accept [QA78142] [G62,49 Westfall][G56,50 Westfall][G52.7,53.8 Westfall][G52,62 Westfall][G45.4,70.4 Westfall] \\ Vultros (elite) flies over central Westfall, Foe Reaper 4000 (elite) walks the fields near 44,35 and Leprithus (elite) rises at night near 42,29: watch for them.
Loot *Rumi of Gnomeregan: The Collected Works* in Sentinel Hill, accept [QA79093] [G52,62 Westfall][G52.7,53.8 Westfall]
Run back east over the bridge into Elwynn [G56,50 Westfall][G62,49 Westfall]
Loot *Archmage Theocritus' Research Journal*, accept [QA79092] [G24.5,74.5 Elwynn Forest][G33,71 Elwynn Forest][G42.1,65.9 Elwynn Forest][G52,66 Elwynn Forest][G62,67.5 Elwynn Forest][G65.4,70.1 Elwynn Forest]
Run back to Stormwind [G62,67.5 Elwynn Forest][G52,66 Elwynn Forest][G42.1,65.9 Elwynn Forest][G38,58 Elwynn Forest][G32,49.6 Elwynn Forest]
Turn in at Garion Wendell: [QT79093] [QT78142] [QT79092] and [QT78150 Friend of the Library] [G48.9,86.5 Stormwind City]
]], 'DungeonQuests - JanRK')
